  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Life in a war-torn empire isn’t easy for a girl. That’s why Kira was raised and educated by her mother as a boy. But when her mother passes away, Kira is left to make her own way in the world, and the older she gets, the harder it is to maintain a masculine appearance. So when a magical being appears one night promising to grant any wish in return for a favor, Kira asks to be given a male voice. Now with a stronger disguise, she accepts a job as a page to a nobleman – and not just any nobleman, but the grand duke! However, the job isn’t nearly as simple as she thought, and Kira will have to work hard and face many challenges ahead if she wants to succeed. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
